stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Organization membership triggers StackSet deployment
accDescr: After initial deployment, automatic deployments add stack instances when accounts enter the target scope and apply the configured removal behavior when they leave.
[*] --> Outside
state "Account outside target scope" as Outside
state "Account joins organization or target OU" as Joined
state "Stack instances in two approved Regions" as Deployed
state "Configured removal behavior" as Removal
Outside --> Joined: Membership changes
Joined --> Deployed: Service-managed automatic deployment
Deployed --> Removal: Account leaves target scope
Removal --> Outside: Delete stacks
Removal --> Retained: Retain resources
state "Resources retained, no longer managed by StackSet" as Retained
